OL,3,GNEWSAAdders tracked with GPS in bid to
OL,4,Aprotect species
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdders are being monitored using GPS
OL,7,Ftrackers to identify what habitat they
OL,8,Fneed to thrive to help support the
OL,9,Flong-term recovery of the protected
OL,10,Fspecies.
OL,12,FA project at Haldon Forest in Devon
OL,13,Fbegan in the spring of 2025 and
OL,14,Fresearch is expected to continue for
OL,15,Fanother three years. Micro radio tags
OL,16,Fhave been taped to the tails of the
OL,17,Fsnakes - coming off as their skins are
OL,18,Fnaturally shed two months later.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
