OL,3,GNEWSAAdders tracked with GPS in bid to
OL,4,Aprotect species
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother project in Cornwall is
OL,7,Fexploring how both natural and
OL,8,Fhuman-made barriers can isolate adder
OL,9,Fpopulations.
OL,11,FAaron Boughtflower, ecologist for west
OL,12,FDevon and Cornwall at Forestry England,
OL,13,Fdesigned the Haldon Forest project and
OL,14,Fsaid: "We've got more adders than we
OL,15,Fthought."
